        { "type": "show_line", "point": [0.5, 1.9, 3.5], "point2": [5.5, 1.9, 3.5], "color": "input", "duration": 110 },
        {
          "type": "text", "duration": 105, "attachKeyFrame": true, "placeNearTarget": true, "point": [2.5, 2.0, 3.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Build the transport first: a powered belt moves east under four downward deployers, each two blocks above it. The end stop keeps items available for collection.",
            "zh_cn": "先搭好真实输送线：动力皮带向东移动，四个机械手朝下，位于皮带上方两格。末端挡块让物品留在出口等待回收。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 110 },
        {
          "type": "text", "duration": 115, "attachKeyFrame": true, "placeNearTarget": true, "point": [2.5, 3.8, 3.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "This real recipe uses one gold sheet and the Silicon, Logic, Engineering and Calculation Presses in that order. All four tools are kept; three passes produce one normal Package Distributor.",
            "zh_cn": "示例配方用一张金板，依次经过硅、逻辑、工程、运算四种压印模板。四种工具均保留，整条线运行三遍得到一个普通封包分发器。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 120 },
        { "type": "show_controls", "action": "right", "item": "createpackage:machine_linker", "point": [1.5, 2.5, 0.5], "direction": "down", "duration": 45 },
        { "type": "highlight_section", "blockPos": [1, 1, 0], "color": "blue", "duration": 75 },
        {
          "type": "text", "duration": 85, "attachKeyFrame": true, "placeNearTarget": true, "point": [1.5, 2.5, 0.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "1. Right-click the Basic Distributor with the Machine Linker to select the host. The normal Distributor uses the same linking procedure.",
            "zh_cn": "① 手持机器链接器右键基础分发器，先选定宿主。普通分发器也使用同样的链接方式。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 90 },
        { "type": "show_controls", "action": "right", "item": "createpackage:machine_linker", "point": [0.5, 1.9, 3.5], "direction": "down", "duration": 40 },
        { "type": "highlight_section", "blockPos": [0, 1, 3], "color": "input", "duration": 70 },
        {
          "type": "text", "duration": 80, "attachKeyFrame": true, "placeNearTarget": true, "point": [0.5, 1.9, 3.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "2. Right-click the first belt segment to mark the input. The distributor supplies the base item here; its own facing does not choose the input.",
            "zh_cn": "② 右键首段皮带，标记入口。分发器会把基础原料送到这里，入口不由分发器自身朝向决定。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 85 },
        { "type": "show_controls", "action": "right", "item": "createpackage:machine_linker", "point": [1.5, 3.7, 3.5], "direction": "down", "duration": 25 },
        { "type": "indicate_success", "blockPos": [1, 3, 3] },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 25 },
        { "type": "show_controls", "action": "right", "item": "createpackage:machine_linker", "point": [2.5, 3.7, 3.5], "direction": "down", "duration": 25 },
        { "type": "indicate_success", "blockPos": [2, 3, 3] },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 25 },
        { "type": "show_controls", "action": "right", "item": "createpackage:machine_linker", "point": [3.5, 3.7, 3.5], "direction": "down", "duration": 25 },
        { "type": "indicate_success", "blockPos": [3, 3, 3] },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 25 },
        { "type": "show_controls", "action": "right", "item": "createpackage:machine_linker", "point": [4.5, 3.7, 3.5], "direction": "down", "duration": 25 },
        { "type": "indicate_success", "blockPos": [4, 3, 3] },
        { "type": "highlight_section", "blockPos": [1, 3, 3], "blockPos2": [4, 3, 3], "color": "white", "duration": 85 },
        {
          "type": "text", "duration": 85, "attachKeyFrame": true, "placeNearTarget": true, "point": [2.5, 3.8, 3.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "3. Right-click all four deployers in process order, from left to right. Link the machines themselves, not every belt segment beneath them.",
            "zh_cn": "③ 按加工顺序从左到右，依次右键四个机械手。标记的是机器本体，无需把机器下方每段皮带都加入路线。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 90 },
        { "type": "show_controls", "action": "right", "item": "createpackage:machine_linker", "point": [5.5, 1.9, 3.5], "direction": "down", "duration": 40 },
        { "type": "highlight_section", "blockPos": [5, 1, 3], "color": "output", "duration": 85 },
        {
          "type": "text", "duration": 95, "attachKeyFrame": true, "placeNearTarget": true, "point": [5.5, 1.9, 3.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "4. Mark the final belt segment last. It is the output: unfinished items return to the input, and finished products return to ME storage.",
            "zh_cn": "④ 最后右键末段皮带，确定出口。到达这里的半成品会被送回入口，成品则直接回到 ME 存储。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 100 },
        { "type": "show_controls", "action": "right", "point": [1.5, 2.5, 0.5], "direction": "down", "duration": 45 },
        {
          "type": "text", "duration": 115, "attachKeyFrame": true, "placeNearTarget": true, "point": [1.5, 2.5, 0.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Put the linker away and right-click to open the Basic Distributor GUI. Insert an encoded processing pattern: 1 gold sheet → 1 normal Package Distributor. Connect powered ME storage and a crafting CPU to request it.",
            "zh_cn": "收起链接器，空手右键打开基础分发器界面，放入已编码处理样板：金板1 → 普通封包分发器1。实际请求合成还需有电的 ME 存储网络与合成 CPU。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 120 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "converter",
      "title": { "en_us": "Converter: Put the Route on a Pattern", "zh_cn": "机械样板转换器：把路线写入样板" },
      "basePlateSize": 7,
      "viewScale": 0.75,
      "steps": [
        { "type": "encapsulate_bounds", "bounds": [7, 5, 7] },
        { "type": "set_block", "block": "createpackage:advanced_package_distributor", "blockPos": [1, 1, 0] },
        { "type": "create_belt", "blockPos": [0, 1, 3], "blockPos2": [5, 1, 3], "speed": -32 },
        { "type": "set_block", "block": "create:andesite_casing", "blockPos": [6, 1, 3] },
        { "type": "set_block", "block": "create:creative_motor", "blockProperties": { "facing": "north" }, "blockPos": [0, 1, 4] },
