          "type": "text", "duration": 95, "attachKeyFrame": true, "placeNearTarget": true, "point": [3.5, 2.3, 3.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Mark the four deployers in order, then the final belt segment. The converter now holds input → four deployers → output for this physical line.",
            "zh_cn": "依次标记四个机械手，再标记末段皮带。转换器中保存的顺序就是：入口 → 四个机械手 → 出口，对应眼前这条真实流水线。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 100 },
        { "type": "show_controls", "action": "right", "item": "createpackage:mechanical_pattern_converter", "point": [3.5, 3.5, 0.5], "direction": "down", "duration": 45 },
        {
          "type": "text", "duration": 110, "attachKeyFrame": true, "placeNearTarget": true, "point": [3.5, 3.5, 0.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Right-click AIR with the converter to open its GUI. Put the encoded AE2 processing pattern, 1 gold sheet → 1 normal Package Distributor, in an input slot and press Convert.",
            "zh_cn": "手持转换器，对空气右键打开转换界面。把已编码 AE2 处理样板“金板1 → 普通封包分发器1”放入输入槽，再点击转换。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 115 },
        {
          "type": "text", "duration": 105, "attachKeyFrame": true, "placeNearTarget": true, "point": [3.5, 3.5, 0.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Take the Mechanical Package Pattern from the output slot. It contains the original encoded pattern, this ordered route and its encoder information; it is not a physical parcel of ingredients.",
            "zh_cn": "从输出槽取出机械封包样板。它保存原始编码样板、有序路线和编码者信息，并不是装着配方原料的实体包裹。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 110 },
        { "type": "show_controls", "action": "right", "point": [1.5, 2.5, 0.5], "direction": "down", "duration": 45 },
        { "type": "highlight_section", "blockPos": [1, 1, 0], "color": "blue", "duration": 90 },
        {
          "type": "text", "duration": 110, "attachKeyFrame": true, "placeNearTarget": true, "point": [1.5, 2.5, 0.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Put the held tool away. Empty-hand right-click the Advanced Distributor to open its GUI, then place the Mechanical Package Pattern in a pattern slot. It needs a powered ME network and a crafting CPU.",
            "zh_cn": "收起手中工具，空手右键高级分发器打开界面，再把机械封包样板放入样板槽。实际合成需要有电的 ME 网络和合成 CPU。"
