        {
          "type": "text", "duration": 95, "attachKeyFrame": true, "placeNearTarget": true, "point": [2.5, 3.7, 3.5],
          "text": {
            "en_us": "An existing encoded Mechanical Package Pattern is also a route tool. While holding it, you can append, replace or remove its own marks without changing the encoded recipe.",
            "zh_cn": "已有编码数据的机械封包样板本身也能作路线工具。手持它可以追加、替换或删除自身的路线标记，原编码配方保持不变。"
          }
        },
        { "type": "idle", "duration": 100 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "edit_and_auto_route",
